# This is the part of Washington Double Star Catalog for Stellarium
#
# Version: $version$
#
# This catalog is based on Washington Double Star Catalog (WDS):
# - Excluded synonyms and stars without coordinates
# - Not all data from original cataloue was transferred
#
# Format:
# + One record per line
# + Fields in a record are delimited with the tab character
# + Line beginning with a # character are comments
# + Columns:
#   - HIP/Gaia DR3
#   - WDS designation
#   - Year of observations
#   - Position angle, in degrees
#   - Separation, in seconds of arc
#